===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|ymage}}, borrowed from {{der|en|fro|image}}, from {{der|en|la|imāgō||a copy, likeness, image}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*h₂eym-}}; the same PIE root is the source of {{m|la|imitari||to copy, imitate}}; see [[imitate]]. {{doublet|en|imago}}.

